---
import { facts, links } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

const infrastructure = [
  `${facts.hosting} that can take over if the main one fails.`,
  'The mainnet node runs on the DoubleZero network and the Jito BAM block engine.',
  'A separate testnet node, maintained as the Solana Foundation Delegation Program requires.',
  'Separate wallet and signer setup for key security; hardened SSH access and port isolation.',
  'Automated monitoring at system and network level, with immediate alerts on delinquency, skipped slots or missed credits.',
];

const transparency = [
  `${facts.commission} commission on staking rewards and ${facts.mevCommission} MEV commission. The full commission history is public on Stakewiz.`,
  `In the Solana Foundation Delegation Program since ${facts.mainnetSince}, with its ongoing performance requirements.`,
  'Full performance history is public on Stakewiz and validators.app. Nothing on this site is the only source.',
  'The monitoring and validator tools I use are open source on GitHub.',
];
---

<section class="section" id="security">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>A reliable validator, openly run</h2>
      <p class="lede">I'm Andrii, the person behind AndrewInUA. My validator has personality and values: it's operated with care, dedication and deep technical responsibility, and you can reach me any time. I believe that transparency isn't optional. It's essential.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="columns">
      <div>
        <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
        <ul>
          {infrastructure.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Transparency</h3>
        <ul>
          {transparency.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}
        </ul>
        <p class="links">
          <a href={links.stakewiz} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="stakewiz" /> Stakewiz</a>
          <a href={links.validatorsApp} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="validators-app" /> validators.app</a>
          <a href={links.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="github" /> GitHub</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why">
      <h3>Why it matters</h3>
      <p>When you stake SOL, your tokens never leave your wallet. They remain yours, protected by the protocol. What you choose is who keeps the network running with your stake. This node is run to stay online, vote reliably and skip nothing, and to give you an honest picture of how it does.</p>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="quote">
      <p>"This node was online during blackouts and air raid alarms. Because I believe decentralization matters, especially when it's hard."</p>
      <footer>Andrii, AndrewInUA</footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .columns {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .columns h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .columns ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  .columns li::marker {
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .links {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .why {
    margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .why h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .why p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .quote {
    margin: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .quote p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .quote footer {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-size: 0.97rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .columns {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
